# Optional. Enables the "Google" option in the location search.
# Without it the app falls back to OpenStreetMap / Nominatim, which needs no key.
#
# This key ships in the client bundle — it cannot be kept secret in a static
# site. Restrict it in Google Cloud Console:
#   - Application restrictions: HTTP referrers -> your Vercel domain(s) + localhost
#   - API restrictions: "Maps JavaScript API" and "Places API (New)" only
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
